PART 4  VERDICTS
============================================================================================================

  V1 -- THE DECOUPLING STATEMENT. PASS.
    the freeze epoch (z* = 2.4, T_b = 9.17-9.52 K = T_CMB(z*)) is the
    sector's decoupling: T_b(5.09 keV, 119.2 km/s) = 9.338 K, z* = 2.426,
    inside the committed [2.3656, 2.4932] band.  The relic population at
    decoupling: the honest occupation factor m/k_B T = 6.44e6 ->
    e^(-6.44e6) = 10^(-2.80e6) (the brief's 6.6e8 corrected to the honest
    6.44e6, a factor 100 lower -- the conclusion is unchanged).  The phase
    is NOT a thermal relic population: its Boltzmann population at T_b is
    ~10^(-2.8e6) of the committed N_ph = 1.53e73; the equilibrium is a
    CONDENSED/COHERENT phase (G028 Noether charge, G233 EOS c_s^2 = 0,
    G235 type-I coherent condensate, max-entropy at T_b, G084) -- the
    honest statement of the sector's statistical nature, G028/G233/G235
