  V2 -- THE DENSITY RECONSTRUCTION. PASS.
    the committed rho = A/r^2 at r_M: rho(r_M) = 3.543e-22 kg/m^3, with
    M_ph(<r_M) = M_b to 1e-16 (equipartition identity, G132 C1).  Under the
    (1+z*)^3 = 39.30 dilution from z* = 2.4, the freeze density is rho(z*)
    = rho(r_M)(1+z*)^3 = 1.393e-20 kg/m^3 = 1.32e5 x the mean matter
    density at z* -- the phantom CONdensed by its freeze epoch; it did not
